# Community Badge Award
# Example Business Knowledge expressed in Menata Language
# Domain: Community — an achievement automatically awarded when a Member's total
# points crosses a declared threshold. The genuinely new pattern this case exists
# to surface: a trigger condition evaluated against an AGGREGATE (sum of points),
# not a single field's value like every prior conditional action (CAP-A09).
# Case 12 of the Case Portfolio (runtime/case-portfolio.md)
# References: community-points.menata

Badge Award

Fields

- Member : User
- Badge : Rising Star | Super Connector | Community Pillar
- Awarded At : Date
- Triggering Rule : Text

Constraints

- Member is required.
- Badge is required.

    A Member may earn a given Badge only once.

Permissions

System

- Award

Views

- My Badges : List
- Badge Detail : Detail
